          "prompt": "For record banking77/train/6456 only: Select the primary intent expressed by this utterance. Match the meaning, not a shared keyword. Select the most specific supported intent. If out_of_scope is available, choose it only when none of the intents applies.\n\nSupported intents:\n- Refund_not_showing_up: The user is inquiring about a refund that has not yet appeared in their account.\n- transfer_timing: The user is asking about the expected timing or duration of a transfer.\n- request_refund: The user is explicitly asking to initiate a refund process.\n- pending_transfer: The user is inquiring about a transfer that is currently in progress or pending.\n- card_arrival: The user is asking about the status or expected arrival of a physical card.\n- card_payment_not_recognised: The user is reporting that a card payment is not being recognized or processed correctly.\n- transaction_charged_twice: The user is reporting that a transaction has been charged to their account more than once.\n- failed_transfer: The user is reporting that a transfer has failed or was unsuccessful.\n- card_delivery_estimate: The user is inquiring about the estimated delivery time or date for a card, or if specific delivery dates can be accommodated.\n- declined_transfer: The user is reporting that a transfer has been declined."
